<title>USA: Fed says 4-day fixed system RPs totaled $6.385 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 4-day fixed system RPs totaled $6.385 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $6.385 billion in temporary reserves to the banking system during a round of 4-day fixed system repurchase agreements on Thursday, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
